  - Mother
  - Mother
  - Little Girl
  - Mother
  - Mother
  - Little Girl
  - Little Girl
  - Mother
  - Little Girl
  - Little Girl
  dialogue:
  - Mother, what happened last night?
  - Did something happen last night?
  - Yes, Mother.
  - A monster chased me across the entire manor, to my room.
  - It was outside when you opened the door.
  - 'No, nothing chased you, honey. '
  - And why were you in the pantry?
  - ... I didn't say I was in the pantry.
  - Oh well.
  - Just don't go down there again!
  - Yes, Mother.
  - What is wrong with the rest of the family?
  - Nothing. Nothing is wrong with them.
  - '*Thinking* Maybe Father knows what happened.'
  - '*Thinking* I did hear his showtgun last night.'
  portrait:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7974f0af01e77c2459ba5035c58aff24, type: 3}
